1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
Cinderella

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Cinderella's Sister

3
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:21,250
Episode 17
I couldn't get hold of you all night.

4
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,800
What in the world are you doing?

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:25,500
Where are you?...Huh??

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,800
How about Mom? Are you with her?

7
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,600
Where are you coming from?

8
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:38,900
Why are you like this? Are you okay?

9
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,200
I'm asking why you're like this...How about Mom?

10
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,600
You said you went out with her.

11
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,600
Mom ran away, Unni.

12
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,100
What?

13
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:00,400
What did you say?

14
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,600
Let's go into your room.

15
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:14,500
I did it because I felt sorry for Dad.

16
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:23,420
I felt so sorry because I couldn't kick Mom out.

17
00:01:25,030 --> 00:01:28,730
I put Ahjussi Jang in front of Dad

18
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:33,300
and I hid behind that action.

19
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:37,000
I held Mom's hand so tightly.

20
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:41,370
Because I didn't want to lose Mom.

21
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:45,400
I went as far to go looking for him but it ended like this.

22
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,200
Mom....and you......

23
00:01:55,300 --> 00:01:59,100
You two women.....

24
00:02:00,810 --> 00:02:03,130
What are they to me?

25
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:08,200
What are they?

26
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
What are they really?

27
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,800
What are they that you can't let go of them?

28
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,600
I'm asking you...

29
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:26,800
If I ask, you should answer.

30
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:33,480
What's the reason you can't let go of Mom and me?

31
00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:38,610
If I were you, I would've let us go more than a dozen times already.

32
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:44,600
No matter how much you are of another world, someone I can't understand

33
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:48,000
and even though you can't distinguish the thing in front of you, if it's a puppy or a wolf.

34
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:52,700
Even if you were born with a fate to love a wolf

35
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:55,780
even knowing Mom did it

36
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,800
without even uttering a word to me, smiling.

37
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:02,600
You held on to me completely exhausted from crying that Mom ran away.

38
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:07,000
You can't do this.

39
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:10,900
I can't do this?

40
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:17,390
Then, Mom can?

41
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:23,000
Who's more ridiculous?

42
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:27,800
Is it me?

43
00:03:31,580 --> 00:03:33,390
It's me.

44
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:45,200
This won't do, Hyo Seon. This simply won’t do.

45
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:52,000
Because Mom and I have committed so many wrongdoings to you, to Dad and to this household...

46
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:56,000
I was determined to live a life just worshipping at your feet.

47
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:58,700
But, this won't do.

48
00:04:01,390 --> 00:04:03,710
Please kick me out, Hyo Seon.

49
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:09,200
Where would you go? Sit down.

50
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,800
Where are you going?

51
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,400
Let go.

52
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,850
Let go! Please let go of me, Hyo Seon.

53
00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:19,800
Please let go of me.

54
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:22,600
No, you can't.

55
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,900
Let go!

56
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:27,600
No! You can't!

57
00:04:28,870 --> 00:04:31,220
I don't want to! I hate you!

58
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:34,200
I hate everything! It's all disgusting!

59
00:04:34,230 --> 00:04:37,040
I told you to let go!

60
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:40,730
How could you not know?

61
00:04:41,770 --> 00:04:47,130
How could you not know a person's feelings, Unni?!

62
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:55,400
You didn't know?

63
00:04:58,040 --> 00:05:00,260
You and Mom...

64
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:04,600
You're both sick

65
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:10,900
You're sick humans.

66
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:23,600
You've lived here for eight years, but how it's possible...

67
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:33,200
How can you turn all that time into nothing?

68
00:05:33,220 --> 00:05:39,250
You and me how can you make us become like we have no relationship.

69
00:05:40,790 --> 00:05:43,330
Between Mom and Dad...

70
00:05:44,300 --> 00:05:46,800
Is Joon Soo.

71
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:50,800
That means that between you and I, we have Joon Soo as well.

72
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:53,900
But, how can you ask me to kick you out?

73
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:57,400
If you are not sick,

74
00:05:57,400 --> 00:06:00,400
