75
00:06:02,650 --> 00:06:06,260
I really think...

76
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:11,380
I'm going to go insane because of you, Goo Hyo Seon.

77
00:06:11,380 --> 00:06:14,620
Goo Eun Jo.

78
00:06:15,710 --> 00:06:19,420
I think I'm going to go insane too.

79
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,820
Mom...

80
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:31,730
Bring her back.

81
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:37,900
I think I'm going insane.

82
00:06:40,340 --> 00:06:42,200
Bring her back.

83
00:06:54,410 --> 00:06:57,450
Hyo Seon's hands...

84
00:06:57,450 --> 00:07:00,800
And Hyo Seon's forehead,

85
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:04,300
Like a hot iron rod, were hot.

86
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:48,000
Should I also pluck out all of the sharpened claws of mine both in my hands and feet

87
00:07:48,760 --> 00:07:53,510
and just hug this feverishly hot child?

88
00:07:54,260 --> 00:07:57,140
So if I also become hot like her

89
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:03,300
would this child I do not understand, will I be able to understand her?

90
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:17,400
Even though my mom ran away, I was not schocked at all by that.

91
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:25,310
It was absolutely nothing compared to the shock given to that child Hyo Seon.

92
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:34,200
I'll ask this of you.

93
00:08:34,230 --> 00:08:37,890
I don't think my mom is seeing Ahjussi again.

94
00:08:37,890 --> 00:08:41,600
We never know so just in case go meet Ahjussi once.

95
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:46,800
Ask where she went, or if she contacted him by any chance.

96
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:48,780
Since she didn't take any money with her when she left,

97
00:08:48,780 --> 00:08:51,400
She might've contacted Ahjussi Jang for some help.

98
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:54,000
I got it. Don't worry.

99
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,360
I'll be back.

100
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:26,000
Is Hyo Seon alright?

101
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,000
Is her fever down?

102
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,800
It went down a little, but she still feels hot.

103
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:37,300
Hyo Seon's grandfather will come.

104
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:46,600
Do you want to go see her for a while?

105
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:49,800
I have to take Joon Soo to kindergarten.

106
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:53,600
Since I woke him up late this morning, he missed the school bus.

107
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:57,000
And what else?

108
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:02,400
What else? Tell me what else.

109
00:10:02,400 --> 00:10:05,400
Because you were sticking to her side like gum,

110
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:08,600
