111
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:11,800
She must have needed this time to herself.

112
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,940
And?

113
00:10:14,940 --> 00:10:18,730
As soon as she clears up her thoughts, I'm sure she'll defintely come back.

114
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:23,300
Now get some sleep until your grandfather comes.

115
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:26,300
Be a good girl.

116
00:10:52,430 --> 00:10:55,920
Goo Joon Soo, raise your head.

117
00:10:57,600 --> 00:11:01,600
I said to raise your head. You have to see what's in front of you.

118
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:04,610
Where did Mom go?

119
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,400
I told you she had some business to do.

120
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,200
When is she coming?

121
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:12,800
I don't know.

122
00:11:14,370 --> 00:11:16,260
In no time. Soon.

123
00:11:20,500 --> 00:11:22,500
Do you know SNSD?

124
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:24,450
What?

125
00:11:24,490 --> 00:11:27,200
What about T-ara?

126
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,400
And U-Kiss?

127
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:31,000
What are you talking about?

128
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:35,300
♪ Do I really seem that easy to you, hey?!♪

129
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:40,400
♪ I used to be nice, soft and tender but if I keep going crazy like this ♪

130
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:44,000
♪ Because of you, I’m turning myself into something strong ♪

131
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:47,300
♪ I have put a spell again on a puppet that looks like you ♪

132
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:51,200
