- And who are you?!

155
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:09,000
Hit him, Kang Sook. I said get your hands off me!

156
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:13,600
Let go! In whose presence do you dare! Go away! Go away I said!

157
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:17,600
Hey! Hey! Who do you think you are?! Hey, hey!

158
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:20,000
Hey, why are you being like this?

159
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:24,800
Crazy man, just leave! What else do you want me to do for you to leave?

160
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:28,100
Don't look over there. Look at me instead.

161
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:33,200
Let's go outside for a little while.

162
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:14,000
