164
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:20,800
Noona, I'll stay with Ahjussi tonight and go back tomorrow. It's already late.

165
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:24,500
Okay then. Ah, right. Jeong Woo...

166
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,600
Goo Joon Soo.

167
00:14:54,100 --> 00:14:59,400
If Mom comes late because she's busy, I'll do that for you.

168
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,500
I can go for you. To your kindergarten.

169
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:09,500
I don't want you to! You're ugly! I'm going to ask Little Noona to go as my partner!

170
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:14,600
But, Little Noona is still sick.

171
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:19,400
If Little Noona is still sick by then, I said I'll do it for you.

172
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:21,700
You're lying!

173
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:24,800
I'm not lying.

174
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:28,200
