180
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:02,400
I always wanted to sort all this out and save it on the computer.

181
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:06,200
Because I might not have enough time, my heart feels rushed.

182
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:10,400
I might not be able to do it, so come and watch.

183
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:14,700
Look, if you don't like what I've sorted out, you can sort it out again.

184
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:17,300
Leave it and go.

185
00:16:18,310 --> 00:16:21,720
I'll take care of it, so leave it and go.

186
00:16:23,800 --> 00:16:26,000
I have to use the computer.

187
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:38,400
As I was organizing I found files not just on alcohol

188
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:42,000
