There's nothing funnier.

204
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:51,400
In this situation, I've been told to dance something cute.

205
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:55,200
My mom is really...

206
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:59,700
She's truly a ridiculous woman.

207
00:19:28,530 --> 00:19:29,920
Let's go.

208
