Are you going to continue to not listen?

211
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:58,400
What are you doing here sitting blankly?

212
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:00,400
I'm waiting.

213
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,500
I'm going to wait.

214
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,800
