215
00:20:09,550 --> 00:20:13,350
Ahjumma... will come back.

216
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:16,800
She did the same thing before.

217
00:20:16,800 --> 00:20:21,000
She would leave somewhere for a while without saying a word,

218
00:20:21,830 --> 00:20:25,030
