219
00:20:25,940 --> 00:20:27,820
If she was going to run away forever,

220
00:20:27,850 --> 00:20:35,690
Ahjumma wouldn't have left neither Noona nor Joon Soo behind.

221
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:39,400
