246
00:22:37,400 --> 00:22:40,800
It would've been nice if we were cordial like that.

247
00:22:43,000 --> 00:22:48,400
Why is it that I held onto you having you see things that you shouldn't be exposed to.

248
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:52,400
