249
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:55,600
Hyo Seon is half dead and Joon Soo keeps asking for you.

250
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:57,600
Why are you being like this?

251
00:22:57,600 --> 00:23:00,800
Mom. If you run away like this, will it make everything better?

252
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:05,000
If Mom just runs away, are you saying that it doesn't matter what happens to the others?

253
00:23:05,000 --> 00:23:08,090
Even if you were to leave, it shouldn't be this way. Where are you?

254
00:23:08,090 --> 00:23:12,000
I'll go to you right away so tell me where you are!

255
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:15,300
I'm contemplating whether I should go or not.

256
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:21,300
Once I reach a decision, I'll let you know as soon as possible.

257
00:23:22,490 --> 00:23:25,180
I haven't decided anything yet.

258
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:28,600
Mom. Mom!

259
00:23:33,970 --> 00:23:37,750
The number you have called does not exist.

260
00:23:40,100 --> 00:23:43,500
It says that it's an untraceable number. What does that mean?

261
00:23:43,500 --> 00:23:46,600
It's probably a public phone. Give me your phone.

262
00:23:48,100 --> 00:23:52,300
She must be around Pohang area. Let's look into it.

263
00:23:55,400 --> 00:23:58,400
This looks like a public phone number.

264
00:23:58,400 --> 00:24:01,600
Could you tell us the exact location?

265
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:05,400
If it's not the exact location, then somewhere close to the vicinity.

266
00:24:12,200 --> 00:24:17,400
What? I can go alone. You're not even feeling well.

267
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:33,400
There's no use thinking for the duration of our ride there.

268
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:35,400
You should nap for a little while.

269
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:38,300
I've contacted your friend Jeong Woo too,

270
00:24:38,300 --> 00:24:41,800
so no matter who arrives first, we'll be able to find her.

271
00:24:42,600 --> 00:24:45,800
We have to find her for Hyo Seon.

272
00:24:46,620 --> 00:24:47,990
I know.

273
00:24:48,050 --> 00:24:52,200
Even if we have to knock on all the doors of every single house in the vicinity, we'll look for her.

274
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:54,400
We will find her.

275
00:24:57,000 --> 00:25:01,000
Leave me the car and go home. I'll go alone.

276
00:25:03,600 --> 00:25:06,200
Go and stay with Hyo Seon.

277
00:25:06,200 --> 00:25:08,600
Grandmother and Ahjumma are home, so don't worry.

278
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:11,400
I said go and stay with her!

279
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:13,200
Don't get so worked up and just close your eyes.

280
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:16,100
I told you to go stay with Hyo Seon!

281
00:25:19,000 --> 00:25:21,200
What are you doing?

282
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,800
I asked what you are doing!

283
00:25:25,800 --> 00:25:29,600
I don't have anything else to reveal to you.

284
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:36,500
Because I've told you everything, I feel at ease.

285
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:41,600
In the past, even though I worried and felt sorry for you,

286
00:25:41,600 --> 00:25:45,500
I couldn't do anything I wanted because I was hiding something.

287
00:25:46,200 --> 00:25:48,400
It's okay now.

288
00:25:48,400 --> 00:25:52,600
No matter what you think of me or how much you dislike me...

289
00:25:52,600 --> 00:25:56,900
From now on, I'm going to allow myself to worry about you. I'll do that.

290
00:25:58,200 --> 00:25:59,800
So boldly?

291
00:25:59,830 --> 00:26:02,990
That's right. I've wanted to be this bold for a long time.

292
00:26:02,990 --> 00:26:05,100
Because I couldn't, I felt like I was going to die.

293
00:26:05,100 --> 00:26:07,400
So don't say anything to me,

294
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:11,600
So while I'm even putting my life on the line to swear loyalty, accept me.

295
00:26:12,400 --> 00:26:15,500
Let's go find your mom.

296
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:36,400
Now that we've driven all around,

297
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:39,800
I think it'd be better to get out and take a walk while looking out for her carefully.

298
00:26:39,800 --> 00:26:43,200
Little Noona, you should rest in the car.

299
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:00,000
Excuse me.

300
00:27:00,710 --> 00:27:07,090
Where is the public pay phone that people use a lot around here?

301
00:27:08,500 --> 00:27:11,800
According to the navigation system, we're near Kyung Jae city.

302
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:14,100
How long will it take for you to get here?

303
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:19,400
Why will it take that long?

304
00:27:22,100 --> 00:27:25,600
I understand. Please come soon.

305
00:27:45,700 --> 00:27:48,500
I don't think we'll be able to take the car.

306
00:27:48,500 --> 00:27:50,200
Then, what are we supposed to do?!

307
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:53,600
When those people get here, we'll leave the car with them and take the bus.

308
00:27:54,700 --> 00:27:56,900
I'm really going insane!

309
00:28:03,500 --> 00:28:09,200
That guy Jeong Woo and Hyo Seon arrived just now. They're already looking for her everywhere.

310
00:28:09,200 --> 00:28:11,000
How can you smile?

311
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:14,800
I guess I want to keep talking to you.

312
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:18,600
There's so much we haven't talked about all this time.

313
00:28:18,600 --> 00:28:23,600
Because there is nothing I need to hide anymore, I feel like I'm going to burst out talking.

314
00:28:23,600 --> 00:28:28,400
Even though this is a very serious situation where we're trying to find your mom.

315
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:31,400
I keep wanting to say things that have nothing to do with this.

316
00:28:32,030 --> 00:28:35,990
I think they're about to pour out of me. Will you listen?

317
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:42,400
- What's wrong with you? What are you doing?
- Come here.

318
00:28:42,400 --> 00:28:43,400
I said to come here.

319
00:28:43,400 --> 00:28:45,800
Why are you doing this?!

320
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:54,400
Lean. It'll be hard otherwise.

321
00:29:00,930 --> 00:29:04,160
You're already getting into a huff, how come you haven't changed.at all?

322
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:14,000
When we first saw each other after 8 years,

323
00:29:14,020 --> 00:29:18,350
I wondered how you could look at me with that glare for a while.

324
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:21,200
It was rude.

325
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:25,000
Stop it. I don't want to hear this. I won't hear you!

326
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:28,100
Lean. Huh? Listen to me.

327
00:29:28,800 --> 00:29:31,600
I'm telling you to lean on something.

328
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:35,400
I can't stand it. It makes me uneasy seeing you jumping up and down by yourself.

329
00:29:58,020 --> 00:30:01,500
I think the place, where we were before near the front entrance of the market,

330
00:30:01,500 --> 00:30:04,800
It looks like a spot where people are bound to pass some time or other.

331
00:30:04,800 --> 00:30:07,200
so I think it'll be better if we stay there and wait.

332
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:11,300
Let's go back there. And before we leave, we can eat a bit.

333
00:30:12,500 --> 00:30:14,200
I have no appetite.

334
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:18,200
If I don't feed Joon Soo's little noona some food, I'll be in big trouble with Noona Eun Jo.

335
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:20,100
Follow me.

336
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:30,600
Welcome!

337
00:30:30,600 --> 00:30:32,200
What would you like? Liquor?

338
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:34,500
Not liquor. Please give us some food.

339
00:30:34,500 --> 00:30:36,600
The pollack soup is good.

340
00:30:36,600 --> 00:30:38,300
We'll take that. Please give us some.

341
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:43,000
Is that okay with you?

342
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:47,900
Anyway, everything tastes the same to me.

343
00:30:51,300 --> 00:30:54,800
Please give me whatever takes you the least time to prepare.

344
00:30:54,800 --> 00:30:57,800
Then, should I give you soup with rice?

345
00:30:57,800 --> 00:31:00,600
Is that the quickest thing to make?

346
00:31:00,600 --> 00:31:03,100
Then, we'll take soup with rice.

347
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:08,200
Two soups with rice at the table over there, Kang Sook.

348
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:27,600
Kang Sook, what are you doing?

349
00:31:27,600 --> 00:31:29,600
Lower your voice!

350
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:32,800
Why? What's wrong?

351
00:31:32,800 --> 00:31:35,800
Give them their food slowly. Please give them a lot.

352
00:31:35,800 --> 00:31:39,000
Give them a lot so that they remain seated and eat for a very long time.

353
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:58,200
Thank you.

354
00:32:27,400 --> 00:32:30,400
Mom! Did Ahjumma leave?

355
00:32:30,400 --> 00:32:32,800
No. Oh, y-yeah!

356
00:32:32,800 --> 00:32:36,600
Ahjumma left her wallet here. All of her money's inside.

357
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:39,200
Where did she go? I'll bring it to her.

358
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:17,000
♫  Leaving behind the time  ♫

359
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:22,400
♫  which was buried in my heart  ♫

360
00:33:22,400 --> 00:33:28,000
♫  I said I longed for you  ♫

361
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:31,300
♫  and waited for you  ♫

362
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:39,500
♫  Even my memory which turned away  ♫

363
00:33:40,600 --> 00:33:44,800
♫  doesn't know that I longed for you  ♫

364
00:33:44,800 --> 00:33:50,400
♫  Looking only in this direction  ♫

365
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:55,200
♫  my two eyes  ♫

366
00:33:55,200 --> 00:34:01,200
♫  can't say they waited for you  ♫

367
00:34:01,200 --> 00:34:07,800
♫  I can't say I'm coming back  ♫

368
00:34:07,800 --> 00:34:13,400
♫  Will you who knows everything about me  ♫

369
00:34:13,460 --> 00:34:16,230
♫  who cannot forget me  ♫

370
00:34:16,230 --> 00:34:19,000
♫  return to me?  ♫

371
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:24,800
♫  If there are tens of thousand who will just love you  ♫

372
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:30,200
♫  If I can always look at you  ♫

373
00:34:30,200 --> 00:34:35,400
♫  The day I return to your side again  ♫

374
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:38,800
♫  will come again  ♫

375
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:48,500
♫  The day I return to your side again  ♫

376
00:35:04,700 --> 00:35:07,200
Han Jeong Woo
We have found Ahjumma

377
00:35:29,980 --> 00:35:32,130
How could you really do this?!

378
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:37,200
Hyo Seon. Listen to what I have to say.

379
00:35:38,600 --> 00:35:44,000
Even if you forcibly drag me away with that kid.

380
00:35:44,000 --> 00:35:46,400
I'll leave again.

381
00:35:46,400 --> 00:35:49,000
And do you think I'll let you?

382
00:35:49,720 --> 00:35:53,250
No matter what I have to do, I'll leave again.

383
00:35:54,030 --> 00:35:55,520
Why?

384
00:35:56,200 --> 00:35:59,900
So, just leave for now.

385
00:36:01,010 --> 00:36:02,650
Why?!

386
00:36:05,200 --> 00:36:08,100
- Hyo Seon.
- Why?

387
00:36:10,200 --> 00:36:13,100
This woman named Song Kang Sook...

388
00:36:13,980 --> 00:36:16,500
For the first time since I was born,

389
00:36:17,500 --> 00:36:23,500
I've realized what I've done that keeps me from holding my head up at the age of 50.

390
00:36:28,150 --> 00:36:30,190
So that's why...

391
00:36:32,400 --> 00:36:36,600
Since I'm out of the house, I can hold my head up.

392
00:36:41,600 --> 00:36:46,800
Then lower your head and live in front of me.

393
00:36:46,800 --> 00:36:49,500
That was to be your punishment!

394
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:52,200
Leave.

395
00:36:52,970 --> 00:36:58,210
Or else I'll be sure to disappear and die.

396
00:36:59,720 --> 00:37:01,600
What did you say?

397
00:37:04,790 --> 00:37:07,260
Disappear and die?

398
00:37:08,100 --> 00:37:13,000
Yeah. Disappear and die.

399
00:37:14,500 --> 00:37:17,030
Go home and ask Eun Jo.

400
00:37:17,030 --> 00:37:19,920
How I lived in the past.

401
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:25,800
What kind of atrocities I committed without batting an eyelid.

402
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:27,600
Ask her.

403
00:37:30,600 --> 00:37:32,800
So, just leave.

404
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:37,600
Because when I'm ready to return home, I will.

405
00:37:37,600 --> 00:37:39,800
I said to leave immediately.

406
00:37:50,200 --> 00:37:52,400
Then promise me.

407
00:37:55,950 --> 00:37:57,860
That you'll come.

408
00:38:00,110 --> 00:38:03,530
If you promise me that you'll come back whenever it's time...

409
00:38:05,380 --> 00:38:07,400
I'll leave.

410
00:38:11,600 --> 00:38:13,600
You won't promise me?

411
00:38:16,200 --> 00:38:19,700
Whenever it's the correct time, I'll go back.

412
00:38:26,050 --> 00:38:29,470
And promise me another thing.

413
00:38:29,470 --> 00:38:32,310
That you won't go anywhere else

414
00:38:32,310 --> 00:38:41,190
and that you'll stay here at your old friend's house.

415
00:38:49,800 --> 00:38:51,600
Alright.

416
00:38:51,600 --> 00:38:55,000
I promise it so leave immediately.

417
00:39:05,300 --> 00:39:10,600
Joon Soo keeps asking for you.

418
00:39:16,600 --> 00:39:19,790
Why is a wench like you worrying about Joon Soo?

419
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:24,100
When I'm his mother. Are you even close to what I am?

420
00:40:07,200 --> 00:40:08,900
What is this?

421
00:40:10,330 --> 00:40:12,320
Did you sleep well?

422
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:21,200
Where are we? When did we get here?

423
00:40:22,150 --> 00:40:25,990
I wanted to let you sleep for just 10 minutes more so I begged the ahjussi,

424
00:40:26,000 --> 00:40:28,400
but 30 minutes passed instead.

425
00:40:30,370 --> 00:40:32,290
What did you say?

426
00:40:33,160 --> 00:40:35,270
Hyo Seon found your mom.

427
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:40,000
We were going to switch buses from here to get there.

428
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:42,400
But, we don't need to.

429
00:40:49,610 --> 00:40:50,590
What did you say?

430
00:40:50,630 --> 00:40:53,200
And so they decided to wait for her at home.

431
00:40:53,200 --> 00:40:56,700
They believed what she said? They believed my mom's words?!

432
00:40:58,200 --> 00:41:00,000
Is she a fool?!

433
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:03,600
Stop lying. You know, Ahjumma!

434
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:05,800
Does it even make sense that you don't know?

435
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:08,400
Ahjumma, you're the one who sent my mom somewhere else!

436
00:41:08,400 --> 00:41:12,000
Where did you send her to? Please tell me, Ahjumma!

437
00:41:12,800 --> 00:41:14,200
I told you that's not the case.

438
00:41:14,200 --> 00:41:19,200
After they came and left, she came right back and packed all her stuff and went out right away!

439
00:41:19,200 --> 00:41:21,600
Then you should have held onto her, Ahjumma!

440
00:41:21,600 --> 00:41:23,800
Hey, I also run a business here.

441
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:28,200
Then I should leave the business empty and only chase your mother's tail?!

442
00:41:28,210 --> 00:41:34,000
This...this... even from when she was little had not even a chick's sleepy seed's worth of respect. You dare behave in this way in front of an adult?

443
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:38,400
Hey, did you even greet me today? You know me!

444
00:41:38,400 --> 00:41:40,000
When you were born I even cut your umbilical cord...

445
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:43,600
Ahjumma! I asked to tell me where my mom went!

446
00:41:43,600 --> 00:41:45,200
Oh, I'm really going crazy.

447
00:41:45,200 --> 00:41:51,000
Hey, if you come at me and behave like this, I wouldn't tell you even if I knew!

448
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:53,400
How in the world am I supposed to tell a kid what she wants to know...

449
00:41:53,400 --> 00:41:56,600
When it's something that I don't even know?!

450
00:41:56,600 --> 00:41:59,600
What a brat. You're really a disrespectful one.

451
00:41:59,600 --> 00:42:02,800
Hey, leave you brat! I can't bear the sight of you.

452
00:42:04,800 --> 00:42:07,600
Hey! You little...

453
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:10,700
Hey! How come you...

454
00:42:23,400 --> 00:42:25,200
Hey, get out. Get out!

455
00:42:25,200 --> 00:42:28,000
Don't even think about coming back here!

456
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:39,600
Open the door, Ahjumma!

457
00:42:39,600 --> 00:42:41,400
Ahjumma, how can you do this?!

458
00:42:41,400 --> 00:42:45,000
How can you do this after my mom abandoned me, Ahjumma?!

459
00:42:45,800 --> 00:42:48,200
Did you encourage her to abandon me?

460
00:42:48,200 --> 00:42:51,000
Open the door, Ahjumma!

461
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:52,600
Let go.

462
00:42:52,600 --> 00:42:54,800
I said to open the door!

463
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:58,500
Open the door. Let go! I said let go of me.

464
00:43:00,200 --> 00:43:02,400
I said let go.

465
00:43:02,400 --> 00:43:05,600
Let go.

466
00:43:05,600 --> 00:43:07,500
I said let go.

467
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:11,000
I said let go of me.

468
00:43:13,400 --> 00:43:15,400
I said let go of me.

469
00:43:24,800 --> 00:43:30,400
She told me that she hasn't thought once about abandoning me...

470
00:43:32,780 --> 00:43:37,360
But, she abandoned me in the end.

471
00:43:39,420 --> 00:43:47,380
Even if I die, you acted as if you'd never leave. So stubborn.

472
00:43:49,020 --> 00:43:51,550
Just because she was having a hard time...

473
00:43:53,930 --> 00:43:56,200
she abandoned me.

474
00:44:10,660 --> 00:44:14,130
When I was young,

475
00:44:14,140 --> 00:44:21,620
some sturdy men grabbed me away from my mom's hands and dragged me into a car.

476
00:44:24,400 --> 00:44:30,300
My mom was running after us crying and begging them not to take me.

477
00:44:32,600 --> 00:44:35,250
And while I was in the car being taken away, I thought

478
00:44:36,420 --> 00:44:40,930
"Oh, my mom is running when she shouldn't."

479
00:44:42,780 --> 00:44:47,150
You shouldn't be running, but you are running.

480
00:44:49,400 --> 00:44:54,600
So that's how I was separated from my mom and ended up abandoning her before I knew it.

481
00:44:57,240 --> 00:45:02,670
While I was growing up, no one would let me see her.

482
00:45:02,690 --> 00:45:06,600
♫  I'm secretly smiling  ♫

483
00:45:06,620 --> 00:45:13,270
One day my mom came looking for me at the house I was living at with my hyungs, because she wanted to see me.

484
00:45:14,340 --> 00:45:21,960
Hyeong wanting to lose my mom, made her run.

485
00:45:22,990 --> 00:45:26,190
If he'd just let me see her once,

486
00:45:29,050 --> 00:45:32,210
she wouldn't have had to pass away like that.

487
00:45:32,260 --> 00:45:37,400
♫  I walk this street again  ♫

488
00:45:37,400 --> 00:45:40,700
I'll find her for you. Your mom.

489
00:45:41,500 --> 00:45:45,500
I'll find her for you.

490
00:45:47,000 --> 00:45:48,800
So don't worry.

491
00:45:48,800 --> 00:45:54,200
♫  In your name when tears appear  ♫

492
00:45:54,200 --> 00:45:56,650
♫  I can't bear it  ♫

493
00:45:56,650 --> 00:46:01,800
♫  So I can't laugh  ♫

494
00:46:01,800 --> 00:46:10,100
♫  I call out your name again  ♫

495
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:35,500
Mom. I miss you.

496
00:46:39,600 --> 00:46:41,900
Mom.

497
00:46:45,200 --> 00:46:49,600
- When is Mom going to come?
- Joon Soo. Don't cry please.

498
00:46:49,600 --> 00:46:52,800
I went to go see Mom

499
00:46:52,800 --> 00:46:57,400
and her friend was so sick.

500
00:46:57,400 --> 00:47:01,000
As soon as her friend gets better, she said she'd come back.

501
00:47:01,800 --> 00:47:04,200
Mom!

502
00:47:05,600 --> 00:47:07,800
Mom...

503
00:47:07,800 --> 00:47:10,600
You bratty little punk.

504
00:47:10,600 --> 00:47:12,800
You bad little punk.

505
00:47:12,800 --> 00:47:15,000
You bratty and beautiful little punk.

506
00:47:15,000 --> 00:47:19,400
You you you you bratty little punk! Punk punk punk punk punk!

507
00:47:19,400 --> 00:47:23,900
You bratty little punk! Punk punk punk punk punk!

508
00:47:27,800 --> 00:47:31,800
You beautiful, bad little punk!

509
00:47:31,800 --> 00:47:33,200
You bad little punk!

510
00:47:33,200 --> 00:47:35,400
Aren't you tired?

511
00:47:35,400 --> 00:47:37,200
Give him to me.

512
00:47:38,990 --> 00:47:43,190
It's okay. He's falling asleep.

513
00:47:47,000 --> 00:47:50,500
Our puppy is sleeping so peacefully.

514
00:47:51,800 --> 00:47:55,500
Our puppy, our beautiful little punk.

515
00:47:56,580 --> 00:47:58,700
He's sleeping so peacefully.

516
00:47:58,700 --> 00:48:03,140
Our puppy... sleep tight.

517
00:48:25,030 --> 00:48:30,920
When you were young and couldn't fall asleep,

518
00:48:32,000 --> 00:48:35,160
did he do the same thing for you like he did for Joon Soo?

519
00:48:38,200 --> 00:48:40,800
What are you talking about?

520
00:48:40,800 --> 00:48:42,600
Dad...

521
00:48:44,790 --> 00:48:47,650
You beautiful punk.

522
00:48:47,650 --> 00:48:50,130
You bratty punk.

523
00:48:51,170 --> 00:48:54,080
You bratty and beautiful little puppy.

524
00:48:59,000 --> 00:49:01,200
What did you just say?

525
00:49:03,180 --> 00:49:06,960
You beautiful punk. You bratty punk.

526
00:49:08,400 --> 00:49:10,400
You bratty and beautiful little puppy.

527
00:49:10,400 --> 00:49:13,400
No, not that.

528
00:49:17,800 --> 00:49:19,600
You said Dad?

529
00:49:22,780 --> 00:49:25,210
Did you say Dad?

530
00:49:31,170 --> 00:49:33,220
Does it feel awkward?

531
00:49:34,590 --> 00:49:41,050
Why is this the first time I'm hearing you say that?

532
00:49:45,920 --> 00:49:48,820
You should have said it earlier.

533
00:49:52,540 --> 00:49:57,790
Why did you act like such a selfish brat?

534
00:50:01,500 --> 00:50:03,100
Hyo Seon.

535
00:50:06,570 --> 00:50:08,190
Tell me.

536
00:50:09,100 --> 00:50:11,200
What if Mom...

537
00:50:12,800 --> 00:50:16,400
if she doesn't keep the promise she made with you,

538
00:50:16,400 --> 00:50:18,900
and doesn't ever come back.

539
00:50:19,800 --> 00:50:22,300
What do you think it'll be like?

540
00:50:26,430 --> 00:50:28,570
She's not coming back?

541
00:50:31,200 --> 00:50:33,400
That's not what I said.

542
00:50:34,990 --> 00:50:36,970
I said "if".

543
00:50:40,200 --> 00:50:42,600
Don't do that.

544
00:50:43,600 --> 00:50:46,400
Don't ask that question.

545
00:50:48,700 --> 00:50:53,200
Please ask me why I believe that Mom is going to return.

546
00:50:58,570 --> 00:51:00,280
Why?

547
00:51:01,100 --> 00:51:04,600
Mom said she couldn't hold her head up.

548
00:51:08,800 --> 00:51:10,400
What did you say?

549
00:51:10,400 --> 00:51:13,300
This woman named Song Kang Sook...

550
00:51:14,200 --> 00:51:17,200
For the first time since I was born,

551
00:51:17,200 --> 00:51:20,400
I've realized what I've done that keeps me from holding my head up.

552
00:51:20,400 --> 00:51:25,800
Mom said that she couldn't hold her head up high?

553
00:51:25,820 --> 00:51:29,880
But abandoning Joon Soo is something

554
00:51:29,880 --> 00:51:35,600
that'll make her even more ashamed to hold her head up.

555
00:51:38,800 --> 00:51:41,200
And also...

556
00:51:42,050 --> 00:51:46,020
It's because I think

557
00:51:46,100 --> 00:51:50,800
Mom feels like me

558
00:51:53,450 --> 00:51:56,560
that I don't want to spit on those years.

559
00:52:02,230 --> 00:52:04,470
You feel like that too.

560
00:52:05,300 --> 00:52:08,320
No matter how hard these past 8 years have been,

561
00:52:08,350 --> 00:52:10,430
no matter how much you disliked me,

562
00:52:10,430 --> 00:52:18,890
wasn't Dad your strength and support?

563
00:52:21,000 --> 00:52:27,200
So, no matter how shitty the things we had experienced were.

564
00:52:29,000 --> 00:52:32,600
you spitting on all of that time that passed,

565
00:52:33,600 --> 00:52:38,900
is the same as spitting on Dad as well.

566
00:52:43,200 --> 00:52:47,300
And the same goes for Mom too.

567
00:52:48,600 --> 00:52:50,800
Even though it's really hard for me to believe,

568
00:52:50,800 --> 00:52:54,400
she said Mom has learned something called shame.

569
00:52:55,340 --> 00:52:57,760
While I wasn't paying attention, Hyo Seon had grown

570
00:52:57,760 --> 00:53:03,400
from a naive girl who could get everything with her silliness and cuteness

571
00:53:03,400 --> 00:53:08,200
to a mature adult who could express her years.

572
00:53:09,190 --> 00:53:15,440
I just remained the same girl who had her claws out.

573
00:53:30,400 --> 00:53:32,400
Who are you?

574
00:53:34,400 --> 00:53:36,800
You're the child of the owner of that restaurant, right?

575
00:53:36,800 --> 00:53:38,800
I asked who you were.

576
00:53:38,800 --> 00:53:43,000
Right. You must be curious about who I am, right?

577
00:53:43,000 --> 00:53:45,000
Are you a kidnapper?

578
00:53:46,100 --> 00:53:47,600
That's not it.

579
00:53:47,600 --> 00:53:52,800
I just wanted to know if you could relay a message to your mother's friend who is staying at your house now.

580
00:53:52,800 --> 00:53:55,200
My mom's friend?

581
00:53:55,200 --> 00:53:57,600
She's not staying at my house right now.

582
00:53:57,600 --> 00:54:01,600
Really? Then, I guess it's not possible.

583
00:54:01,600 --> 00:54:04,800
Okay. I'm sorry for taking some of your time when you're on your way to school.

584
00:54:04,800 --> 00:54:07,000
But, what did you want to tell her?

585
00:54:07,020 --> 00:54:08,880
You said she wasn't staying here.

586
00:54:08,880 --> 00:54:11,640
If she's not there, there's nothing that can be done.

587
00:54:12,800 --> 00:54:14,100
Go.

588
00:54:25,800 --> 00:54:27,200
Mom!

589
00:54:40,340 --> 00:54:42,690
Yes, hello?

590
00:54:43,800 --> 00:54:45,700
Who did you say you were?

591
00:54:47,600 --> 00:54:49,500
Director Park?

592
00:54:51,000 --> 00:54:52,500
Yes.

593
00:54:54,130 --> 00:54:55,770
Yes.

594
00:54:59,130 --> 00:55:00,690
Yes.

595
00:55:14,800 --> 00:55:17,200
Someone must have come looking for you.

596
00:55:17,200 --> 00:55:19,800
A certain ahjussi did.

597
00:55:29,400 --> 00:55:32,500
Jeong Woo, we need to talk.

598
00:55:42,600 --> 00:55:46,000
Eun Jo has just left the research lab and is heading here right now,

599
00:55:46,000 --> 00:55:48,800
but stop her along the way and keep her away so that she can't come to the winery.

600
00:55:48,800 --> 00:55:50,000
What's going on?

601
00:55:50,000 --> 00:55:51,600
I don't have time to explain.

602
00:55:51,600 --> 00:55:54,000
Take her somewhere else and stay with her until late afternoon.

603
00:55:54,000 --> 00:55:55,500
Hurry.

604
00:56:02,200 --> 00:56:04,400
Yes, this is Hong Gi Hoon.

605
00:56:06,200 --> 00:56:08,600
I'm booting it now.

606
00:56:08,600 --> 00:56:12,400
Please tell me a little more about the documents you've sent me.

607
00:56:12,400 --> 00:56:16,000
I've got a call that the elders of Dae Seong True Winemakers are on their way over here right now.

608
00:56:16,000 --> 00:56:19,200
By any chance, does this have anything to do with it?

609
00:56:29,800 --> 00:56:32,500
Where are we going right now?

610
00:56:32,500 --> 00:56:35,600
You said that you wanted to go somewhere with me. There's this really killer place.

611
00:56:35,600 --> 00:56:37,600
I have to go to the winery now.

612
00:56:37,600 --> 00:56:40,800
I have to take Hyo Seon to the hospital to see why she can't taste anything,

613
00:56:40,800 --> 00:56:44,400
I have to find Mom and look after Joon Soo as well.

614
00:56:44,400 --> 00:56:47,600
I don't know what this is about, but stop fooling around and go back to the winery.

615
00:56:47,600 --> 00:56:50,000
Seonbae Hong is at the winery.

616
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:52,600
Grandmother and Ahjumma can look after Joon Soo.

617
00:56:52,600 --> 00:56:55,400
And Joon Soo's little noona went to give an interview for a magazine.

618
00:56:55,400 --> 00:56:59,200
And your mom said she'd come back so all we have to do is wait.

619
00:57:00,600 --> 00:57:01,400
Jeong Woo.

620
00:57:01,400 --> 00:57:03,800
I have something I have to tell you!

621
00:57:08,000 --> 00:57:11,200
I don't have any other intention, but I'm sick.

622
00:57:11,200 --> 00:57:13,200
It seems I don't have much time left.

623
00:57:13,200 --> 00:57:18,400
Before I leave, I didn't want to leave such untied ends behind.

624
00:57:18,440 --> 00:57:23,010
Hongju Brewery don't know if they don't.

625
00:57:23,010 --> 00:57:27,260
The fact that they know is very worrisome.

626
00:57:39,200 --> 00:57:41,400
I understand.

627
00:57:41,400 --> 00:57:45,300
I'll discuss this with the two daughters of the family and meet with you all again.

628
00:57:46,770 --> 00:57:48,840
But...

629
00:57:48,850 --> 00:57:52,700
I'd like to know about the terms and conditions offered to you

630
00:57:52,700 --> 00:57:57,370
for the transfer of your shares to Hong Joo Ga.

631
00:58:04,600 --> 00:58:07,200
I'll take the liberty of addressing you all.

632
00:58:07,200 --> 00:58:11,200
Dae Seong True Winemakers is not a company that can be handed over to scum like Hong Joo Ga.

633
00:58:11,200 --> 00:58:13,600
I don't know what conditions Hong Joo Ga offered you all but...

634
00:58:13,600 --> 00:58:17,600
Shut your mouth. Aren't you just an employee here?

635
00:58:17,600 --> 00:58:18,800
Yes I am, but Elder-

636
00:58:18,800 --> 00:58:20,800
We came here to meet with the two daughters of this household.

637
00:58:20,800 --> 00:58:24,000
I did not come to report to you.

638
00:58:24,000 --> 00:58:26,400
We'd better come back tomorrow.

639
00:58:29,000 --> 00:58:30,600
Elders.

640
00:58:32,200 --> 00:58:36,400
Hyo Seon and Eun Jo are still shocked by the President's sudden death.

641
00:58:36,400 --> 00:58:38,800
The company and factory have had bad setbacks and

642
00:58:38,800 --> 00:58:43,200
the mother of the two children has even left their house, so they're emotionally and physically exhausted.

643
00:58:43,230 --> 00:58:47,150
If Hyo Seon and Eun Jo hear what you elders have to say,

644
00:58:47,150 --> 00:58:50,450
I don't think they'll have energy left to hold on much longer

645
00:58:53,800 --> 00:58:57,600
Please tell me the conditions offered by Hong Joo Ga.

646
00:58:57,600 --> 00:59:01,700
And also, please give us some more time

647
00:59:01,700 --> 00:59:04,000
so that I can both protect Daeseong True Winemakers

648
00:59:04,000 --> 00:59:07,800
while not burdening the elders. There will definitely be a way.

649
00:59:07,800 --> 00:59:12,000
As you know the orders have been overflowing from not only domestically but from overseas.

650
00:59:12,000 --> 00:59:15,400
That's enough. We won't listen anymore.

651
00:59:15,400 --> 00:59:17,600
We'll come back tomorrow.

652
00:59:37,240 --> 00:59:38,940
From Park Ki Man - To Hong Gi Hoon: Please read this.

653
00:59:39,000 --> 00:59:41,000
This is regarding Dae Seong True Winemakers...

654
00:59:41,000 --> 00:59:42,370
About Daeseong True Winemakers.hwp

655
00:59:49,400 --> 00:59:51,000
Jeong Woo.

656
00:59:52,000 --> 00:59:56,000
I don't even have the energy to get angry. Why are you doing this?

657
00:59:56,000 --> 00:59:58,800
You know that I'm not in a situation where I can relax and play around in a place like this!

658
00:59:58,800 --> 01:00:01,500
Why are you acting like this too when you already know?!

659
01:00:01,500 --> 01:00:03,400
What date is it today?

660
01:00:05,030 --> 01:00:07,350
Do you know what date is today?

661
01:00:08,600 --> 01:00:11,800
I didn't do this because I wanted to celebrate my birthday,

662
01:00:11,800 --> 01:00:15,200
but still, I thought you'd make some seaweed soup for me.

663
01:00:17,590 --> 01:00:21,290
Don't be like that, stop frowning. Relax your face.

664
01:00:21,300 --> 01:00:24,800
For just one day, what I wanted Noona is...

665
01:00:24,800 --> 01:00:29,800
for you to stop thinking about the winery, your household problems, you mom, and to get rid you of all your worries.

666
01:00:32,300 --> 01:00:34,200
Have you ever rested?

667
01:00:35,800 --> 01:00:37,610
You haven't, right?

668
01:00:39,000 --> 01:00:43,800
Noona, you resting will be my birthday present.

669
01:00:43,800 --> 01:00:46,000
You don't want to give me this present?

670
01:00:47,750 --> 01:00:49,660
You won't give me this?

671
01:01:08,400 --> 01:01:10,600
Are you Director Park?

672
01:01:10,600 --> 01:01:13,600
I'm not anymore, but it's fine if you call me that.

673
01:01:13,600 --> 01:01:15,400
Please sit down.

674
01:01:21,000 --> 01:01:23,800
We didn't have to meet in person.

675
01:01:23,800 --> 01:01:25,800
Thank you for taking the time to see me.

676
01:01:25,800 --> 01:01:28,000
Are you curious about my intentions?

677
01:01:28,000 --> 01:01:30,800
To be honest, that's right I am.

678
01:01:30,800 --> 01:01:33,400
The reason you gave me those documents.

679
01:01:33,420 --> 01:01:39,870
I had fallen victim to many things, so hoped that you would take on my rage.

680
01:01:40,520 --> 01:01:45,570
Look here, I'll be honest. That is part of it. No, it's probably most of it.

681
01:01:45,600 --> 01:01:50,500
I have a heart to be furious, but it's not manly.

682
01:01:50,500 --> 01:01:53,000
And I had taken a lot of benefits all this time

683
01:01:53,000 --> 01:01:58,000
so even with that I can live quietly.

684
01:01:58,970 --> 01:02:03,500
But when a person gets sick and finds out he's dying soon,

685
01:02:03,500 --> 01:02:07,700
it's the right thing to believe in the sincerity of the words said by those who are about to die.

686
01:02:09,000 --> 01:02:11,600
And above all

687
01:02:11,600 --> 01:02:16,200
whether my intentions are pure or tainted

688
01:02:16,200 --> 01:02:19,900
What's wrong is still wrong, isn't that so?

689
01:02:21,120 --> 01:02:25,790
Those documents whichever way you use them, it's fine.

690
01:02:25,800 --> 01:02:30,960
Whether you expose them to the world or you put them as a condition to save Daeseong True Winemakers

691
01:02:30,980 --> 01:02:34,100
and cut a deal with the Hongju Family.

692
01:02:34,100 --> 01:02:37,800
If we need to submit all those documents to the prosecutor's office

693
01:02:37,800 --> 01:02:42,400
and report Hongju Family, then you General Director would be investigated.

694
01:02:42,400 --> 01:02:46,600
You think it'll be just an investigation? I'll probably wear a pair of handcuffs.

695
01:02:47,950 --> 01:02:50,220
I'm prepared for what's to come.

696
01:02:51,200 --> 01:02:52,800
But, you're sick.

697
01:02:52,830 --> 01:02:59,280
Those are my circumstances and I'll deal with them on my own.

698
01:03:11,400 --> 01:03:14,800
♫  In the depth of my heart  ♫

699
01:03:14,800 --> 01:03:20,000
♫  When loneliness comes again  ♫

700
01:03:21,300 --> 01:03:26,220
♫  I also don't know again what you intend  ♫

701
01:03:26,220 --> 01:03:29,620
♫  Without saying anything, smile again  ♫

702
01:03:29,620 --> 01:03:31,320
Noona!

703
01:03:32,480 --> 01:03:34,250
♫  More than saying you loved me  ♫

704
01:03:34,250 --> 01:03:36,200
Buy this for me.

705
01:03:36,220 --> 01:03:37,980
Stop fooling around.

706
01:03:38,020 --> 01:03:40,190
This one looks like you.

707
01:03:40,190 --> 01:03:42,200
How does this look like me?

708
01:03:42,240 --> 01:03:44,670
And you look like this one.

709
01:03:44,680 --> 01:03:46,150
♫  I said I liked you so much  ♫

710
01:03:46,150 --> 01:03:47,800
You don't think it looks like you?

711
01:03:47,800 --> 01:03:52,200
♫  Today you must tell me  ♫

712
01:03:52,200 --> 01:03:56,400
♫  My love, will you run to me?  ♫

713
01:03:56,400 --> 01:03:57,600
Don't do it.

714
01:03:57,600 --> 01:03:59,400
Please, it's for my birthday.

715
01:03:59,400 --> 01:04:00,400
You're going to keep fooling around?

716
01:04:00,400 --> 01:04:03,800
♫  I too unconsciously am waiting for you  ♫

717
01:04:03,800 --> 01:04:09,000
♫  Today for me is the day for your sake  ♫

718
01:04:09,000 --> 01:04:11,600
♫  I am going to love you this way  ♫

719
01:04:11,600 --> 01:04:13,300
Let's go.

720
01:04:16,420 --> 01:04:19,240
Take it off.

721
01:04:36,000 --> 01:04:37,800
Go in.

722
01:04:52,800 --> 01:04:54,200
Eun Jo.

723
01:05:04,030 --> 01:05:06,340
What's going on here?

724
01:05:07,000 --> 01:05:09,600
That person is crazy.

725
01:05:09,600 --> 01:05:12,200
Why does he call me like that?

726
01:05:12,200 --> 01:05:14,000
Come over here.

727
01:05:14,800 --> 01:05:17,500
Did he forgot the sins he committed?

728
01:05:17,500 --> 01:05:19,800
Why does he call me like that?

729
01:05:20,780 --> 01:05:23,380
I said come here.

730
01:05:25,180 --> 01:05:27,290
He's smiling.

731
01:05:28,560 --> 01:05:32,910
He's definitely crazy.

732
01:05:34,800 --> 01:05:42,600
And I'm definitely crazy too.

733
01:05:44,130 --> 01:05:48,000
♫  It must be you  ♫

734
01:05:48,000 --> 01:05:51,600
♫  I cannot be without you  ♫

735
01:05:51,600 --> 01:05:58,600
♫  Like this for another day, month or year  ♫

736
01:05:58,600 --> 01:06:02,300
♫  I don't mind even if I am hurt.  ♫
